@startuml 09-sequence-account-service
title account-service - Diagrama de secuencia

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "Cliente\n(Postman)" as User
participant "AccountController\n(inbound adapter)" as Controller
participant "AccountCommandService" as Cmd
participant "AccountOperationService" as Op
participant "AccountQueryService" as Qry
participant "PolicyFactory /\nOperationRuleFactory" as Factory
participant "Strategy\n(Policy / Rule)" as Strategy
participant "AccountRepositoryPort\n+ R2dbcAdapter" as Repo
participant "CustomerQueryPort\n+ WebClientAdapter" as CustGw
participant "MovementGatewayPort\n+ WebClientAdapter" as MovGw
database "PostgreSQL\naccount_db" as DB
participant "customer-service" as CustSvc
participant "transaction-service" as TxSvc

== 1. Abrir cuenta (POST /api/v1/accounts) ==
User -> Controller : POST /accounts {accountType, holders, currency, ...}
Controller -> Cmd : create(command)
loop por cada holderId recibido
  Cmd -> CustGw : findById(holderId)
  CustGw -> CustSvc : GET /customers/{holderId}
  CustSvc --> CustGw : cliente (tipo, estado)
  CustGw --> Cmd : CustomerSnapshot
end
alt un titular no existe
  Cmd --> Controller : ResourceNotFoundException
  Controller --> User : 404 Not Found
else algun titular esta INACTIVE
  Cmd --> Controller : BusinessRuleViolationException
  Controller --> User : 422 Unprocessable Entity
else todos existen y estan activos
  Cmd -> Repo : findByHolderIds(holderIds)
  Repo -> DB : SELECT cuentas de todos los titulares
  DB --> Repo : cuentas existentes
  Repo --> Cmd : cuentas existentes por titular
  Cmd -> Factory : get(customerType / holder types)
  Factory --> Cmd : Personal / BusinessAccountCreationPolicy
  Cmd -> Strategy : validate(account, all holders, existingAccounts)
  alt tipos de titular o reglas de apertura no validos
    Strategy --> Cmd : BusinessRuleViolationException
    Cmd --> Controller : error
    Controller --> User : 422 Unprocessable Entity
  else reglas validas
    Cmd -> Repo : save(account with balance zero)
    Repo -> DB : INSERT cuenta + titulares + firmantes
    note right of DB
      Restricciones unicas respaldan las reglas de
      titularidad/producto ante altas concurrentes.
      La colision se traduce a 422.
    end note
    DB --> Repo : OK / unique constraint violation
    alt conflicto de restriccion unica
      Repo --> Cmd : DuplicateProductException
      Cmd --> Controller : error
      Controller --> User : 422 Unprocessable Entity
    else cuenta guardada
      Repo --> Cmd : Single<Account>
      Cmd --> Controller : Single<Account>
      Controller --> User : 201 Created + Location
    end
  end
end

== 2. Depositar (POST /api/v1/accounts/{id}/deposits) ==
User -> Controller : POST /accounts/{id}/deposits\n{amount, currency, description}
Controller -> Op : deposit(operationCommand)
Op -> Repo : findById(accountId)
Repo -> DB : SELECT
DB --> Repo : cuenta (contador mensual + version)
Repo --> Op : Maybe<Account>
alt cuenta no existe
  Op --> Controller : ResourceNotFoundException
  Controller --> User : 404 Not Found
else cuenta existe
  Op -> Factory : get(accountType)
  Factory --> Op : Savings / Checking / FixedTermOperationRule
  Op -> Strategy : validate(account, DEPOSIT, amount, today)
  alt regla no se cumple
    Strategy --> Op : BusinessRuleViolationException
    Op --> Controller : error
    Controller --> User : 422 Unprocessable Entity
  else regla se cumple
    Op -> Op : account.deposit(amount)\naccount.registerMovement(today)
    Op -> Repo : save(account)
    Repo -> DB : UPDATE cuenta WHERE version = ?
    alt version desactualizada
      DB --> Repo : conflicto de concurrencia
      Repo --> Op : ConcurrentModificationException
      Op --> Controller : error
      Controller --> User : 409 Conflict
    else saldo guardado
      DB --> Repo : OK
      Repo --> Op : Single<Account>
      Op -> MovGw : register(movementCommand)
      MovGw -> TxSvc : POST /api/v1/movements
      alt movimiento registrado
        TxSvc --> MovGw : 201 Created + Movement
        MovGw --> Op : MovementReceipt
        Op --> Controller : MovementReceipt
        Controller --> User : 201 Created
      else fallo confirmado del registro
        TxSvc --> MovGw : error definitivo
        MovGw --> Op : error
        Op -> Op : account.compensate(DEPOSIT, amount)
        Op -> Repo : restoreAfterFailedMovement(previousState, version)
        Repo -> DB : UPDATE compensatorio con control de version
        DB --> Repo : OK / conflicto de concurrencia
        note right of Repo
          Si otra operacion modifico la cuenta primero,
          no sobrescribirla: requiere reconciliacion.
        end note
        Op --> Controller : error
        Controller --> User : 503 Service Unavailable
      else timeout de resultado ambiguo
        MovGw --> Op : timeout; movimiento posiblemente guardado
        note right of Op
          No compensar automaticamente: reconciliar el
          movimiento antes de decidir el estado final.
        end note
        Op --> Controller : resultado indeterminado
        Controller --> User : 503 Service Unavailable
      end
    end
  end
end

== 3. Retirar (POST /api/v1/accounts/{id}/withdrawals) ==
User -> Controller : POST /accounts/{id}/withdrawals\n{amount, currency, description}
Controller -> Op : withdraw(operationCommand)
note over Op, MovGw
  Mismos pasos que el deposito; ademas se valida saldo suficiente.
  Se actualiza el saldo con bloqueo optimista y se registra
  el movimiento. Fallo confirmado: compensacion local; timeout:
  resultado ambiguo y reconciliacion.
end note
Op --> Controller : MovementReceipt / error
Controller --> User : 201 Created / error HTTP correspondiente

== 4. Consultar saldo (GET /api/v1/accounts/{id}/balance) ==
User -> Controller : GET /accounts/{id}/balance
Controller -> Qry : getBalance(accountId)
Qry -> Repo : findById(accountId)
Repo -> DB : SELECT
DB --> Repo : cuenta
Repo --> Qry : Maybe<Account>
Qry --> Controller : Single<Balance>
Controller --> User : 200 OK {balance, currency}

note over User, TxSvc
  Los demas CRUD (GET list paginado con page/size, GET by id, PUT, DELETE)
  siguen el patron buscar -> validar -> guardar. PUT no cambia tipo ni saldo.
  El historial de movimientos se consulta en transaction-service.
end note

@enduml
